### çalışan oluştur 
POST http://localhost:8000/employees
Content-Type: application/json 

{
    "name": "Galip",
    "last_name": "Diler",
    "department":"AI Engineering",
    "age": 26
}

### Departman güncelle 
PATCH http://localhost:8000/employees/123
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "department":"LLM Engineering"
}

PATCH /employees/42
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "department": "LLM Engineering"
}
PUT /employees/42
Content-Type:application/json
{
    "name":"Galip"
    "department":"AI Engineering"
    "age":26
}